@display("std/files")
files: component(path = "std/files", lang = "heron") {
  | Files as a capability of a run: reading, writing and a run's temporary paths.
  |
  | Its surface is declared in `std/files/package.heron`, whose types the API
  | reference renders; each export is specified where its behaviour is:
  |
  | | Export                  | Specified in                                                                                                                                   |
  | | ----------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
  | | `read`, `write`, `temp` | [Files](#language.scripting.processes_and_files.files)                                                                                         |
  | | `FileError`             | [File errors](#language.scripting.processes_and_files.files.file_errors), [declared errors](#language.scripting.code.failures.declared_errors) |

  uses = [language.std.types]
}
